 ## Customer data protection, email and returns
 
-ShopEasy 2.8.94 includes an auditable order status timeline, optional order emails (disabled unless explicitly enabled), return/exchange/refund request records, low-stock dashboard warnings and encrypted database/media backup tooling. Review `DATABASE-BACKUP-RESTORE.md` before using real customer data. A backup is not considered safe until restored and verified against a separate empty database.
